"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":1,"text":"The two cars got locked together and the officials tried for several minutes to separate them","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":1,"text":"Meanwhile, there had been another incident on the first lap as \"Jamy's\" Bugatti had caught fire and even if the fire was soon extinguished he had to abandon the race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":2,"text":"Etancelin is freed and rejoins, three laps down; Canin retires on the spot.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":3,"text":"Chiron leads Falchetto by 10 seconds.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":5,"text":"Hell\u00e9-Nice and Roux retire; seven cars remain.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":10,"text":"Chiron has slowed and Falchetto is just behind him.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"On the next lap Chiron retired to the pits with a broken oil pipe. Falchetto now led by more than 30s over a surprisingly weak Dreyfus.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":15,"text":"Falchetto's speed dropped with his lap time going from 1m18s on lap 10 up to 1m21s on lap 15.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"After 20 laps Falchetto lead Dreyfus by 14seconds with Czaykowski in third position a lap behind, followed by Druck, Etancelin and Cousini\u00e9.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"Etancelin was going at full speed doing his best to pull in the hopeless 3 laps gap to the leader.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":29,"text":"With Dreyfus closing in Falchetto speeded up again and made the 29th lap in 1m16s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"After 40 laps Falchetto led by 42s seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":45,"text":"Druck stops on track for a new wheel and is excluded for fetching it from the pit on foot; Etancelin moves up to fourth.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":60,"text":"Falchetto leads Dreyfus by 26 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"Falchetto wins, Dreyfus second a lap behind; Czaykowski third, Etancelin fourth after a hard fight with Cousini\u00e9.","q":false,"c":0}]}